# 构建上下文排除项：只把"运行应用所必需"的东西送进镜像。
# 目的有两个：① 镜像更小；② 避免把本地 .env / 凭据 / 会话库 / 日志误打进镜像。

# --- 凭据与本地配置（最重要）---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
_token.txt
_device_code.txt

# --- 版本控制与 CI ---
.git
.gitignore
.github

# --- 运行期产物（本地状态，绝不能进镜像）---
index/
data/
generated/
logs/
models/
*.log
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-wal

# --- 测试与覆盖率产物 ---
tests/
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
junit/
report.html

# --- 打包产物 ---
dist/
build/
*.spec.bak

# --- 文档与素材（运行时不需要）---
legacy/
assets/
docs/

# --- Python 缓存 ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.venv/
venv/

# --- 开发/桌面端可选依赖与脚本 ---
requirements-dev.txt
requirements-desktop.txt
Pray.spec
*.bat
